<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<workout_file>
  <author>Gravel God Training</author>
  <name>Endurance — Cadence Focus</name>
  <description>WARM-UP:
- 9min building from Z1 into the Z2 target

MAIN SET:
- 44min @ 68% FTP (Z2, RPE 3)
- Drill: 30sec spin-up @ 100-110rpm every 10min — no extra power, just leg speed
- Position: Stay relaxed on the hoods; keep shoulders quiet
- Cadence: Every 10 min, spin 30 sec at 100-110rpm, then settle smoothly

COOL-DOWN:
- 9min easy spin Z1-Z2 (RPE 3-4)</description>
  <sportType>bike</sportType>
  <workout>
    <Warmup Duration="540" PowerLow="0.50" PowerHigh="0.65" />
    <SteadyState Duration="2640" Power="0.68" />
    <Cooldown Duration="540" PowerLow="0.68" PowerHigh="0.45" />
  </workout>
</workout_file>